{"id": "13", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small frog sits in the leaves of a green bush at night, surrounded by the soothing sounds of frogs and crickets chirping and croaking.", "pred": "The video shows a digital representation of a forest with green, textured squares, accompanied by the croaking of a frog. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video shows a digital representation of a forest with green, textured squares, accompanied by the croaking of a frog. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual content: The video shows a series of green, textured, square patterns that resemble a digital or abstract representation of a forest or leafy environment.\n2. Analyze the audio content: The audio features the distinct croaking of a frog in a natural, outdoor setting.\n3. Combine the visual and audio elements: The visual patterns and the frog's croaking create an auditory-visual scene that suggests a digital or virtual representation of a natural environment, such as a forest or swamp.\nThe visual content depicts a digital or abstract representation of a natural environment with green, textured squares resembling leaves or a forest, while the audio captures the croaking of a frog in a natural setting, suggesting a virtual or simulated depiction of an outdoor scene.\nThe visual content depicts a digital or abstract representation of a natural environment with green, textured squares resembling leaves or a forest, while the audio captures the croaking of a frog in a natural setting, suggesting a virtual or simulated depiction of a natural outdoor scene.\n\nThe video shows a digital representation of a forest with green, textured squares, accompanied by the croaking of a frog. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 25.547, "generation_time_seconds": 23.5599, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1167, "record_process": tru