{"id": "18", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is scrapping and filing wood while a man talks, surrounded by wooden toys and a barking dog in the background.", "pred": "A collage of abstract patterns and textures in various colors and shapes is accompanied by a series of mechanical and impact sounds interspersed with guttural, throaty speech, creating a chaotic and intense experience. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A collage of abstract patterns and textures in various colors and shapes is accompanied by a series of mechanical and impact sounds interspersed with guttural, throaty speech, creating a chaotic and intense experience. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual elements: The image contains a collage of abstract patterns and textures in various colors and shapes.\n2. Analyze the audio elements: The audio consists of a series of mechanical and impact sounds interspersed with speech in a language with guttural, throaty quality.\n3. Combine the sensory details: The video presents a juxtaposition of static, abstract visuals and dynamic, raw audio, creating a disjointed and intense visual and auditory experience.\nThe visual and auditory elements combine to create a chaotic and intense experience, with the abstract patterns and raw sounds working in contrast to each other.\nThe visual elements consist of a collage of abstract patterns and textures in various colors and shapes, while the audio includes a series of mechanical and impact sounds interspersed with speech in a guttural, throaty language, creating a chaotic and intense experience.\n\nA collage of abstract patterns and textures in various colors and shapes is accompanied by a series of mechanical and impact sounds interspersed with guttural, throaty speech, creating a chaotic and intense experience. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 29.388, "generation_time_seconds": 27.5189, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0355, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -1.7617, -0.045, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0042, -9.5034, -16.1461, -11.875, -5.278, -5.6863, -3.2621, -1.2402, -0.3197, -0.5199, -0.5139, -0.2599, -0.2013, -0.4324, -2.0692, -1.1636, -0.3332, -0.157, -0.6983, -1.6728, -2.024, -0.6972, -0.1182, -0.0103, -0.0103, -0.0793, -0.8139, -2.1477, -1.8563, -0.1922, -0.0089, -0.0111, -0.0745, -0.688, -0.7645, -0.0592, -0.0248, -0.0301, -0.1846, -0.4771, -0.6605, -0.1946, -0.0068, -0.0147, -0.1296, -0.3873, -0.0745, -0.0163, -0.0085, -0.0192, -0.0241, -0.0397, -0.0323, -0.027, -0.0183, -0.0244, -0.0439, -0.1455, -0.2116, -0.5222, -1.177, -0.4717, -0.1792, -0.0449, -0.0546, -0.0875, -0.3432, -0.3765, -0.1557, -0.1342, -0.2956, -0.554, -0.2789, -0.1204, -0.1441, -0.3159, -1.4863, -1.7095, -1.0578, -0.3071, -0.1283, -0.4178, -2.0794, -4.2624, -4.824, -3.403, -2.6288, -1.5975, -1.6458, -3.0367, -4.4209, -3.8153, -0.81