{"id": "19", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a blurry room, a man shouts before and after a person belches loudly, while a young woman in a black kitchen smiles by a plate of food with meat and onions.", "pred": "The audio features a male voice speaking in English followed by a burp sound, while the visual shows a grid of abstract, blurry, orange-toned squares with varying patterns and textures. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The audio features a male voice speaking in English followed by a burp sound, while the visual shows a grid of abstract, blurry, orange-toned squares with varying patterns and textures. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content: The visual consists of a grid of abstract, blurry, orange-toned squares with varying patterns and textures.\n2. Analyze the audio content: The audio features a male voice speaking in English, followed by a burp sound.\n3. Ensure modality independence: The visual does not provide any specific details that would influence the interpretation of the audio.\n4. Avoid assumptions: There are no additional details in the visual that confirm or contradict the audio content.\n5. Compress the information: Focus on the key elements of the visual and audio without elaboration.\n6. Format the description: Ensure\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in English followed by a burp sound, while the visual shows a grid of abstract, blurry, orange-toned squares with varying patterns and textures. \\boxed{}\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in English followed by a burp sound, while the visual shows a grid of abstract, blurry, orange-toned squares with varying patterns and textures. \\boxed{}\n\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in English followed by a burp sound, while the visual shows a grid of abstract, blurry, orange-toned squares wit