{"id": "33", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of an aircraft engine hums as the wing of an airplane flies through a blue sky with clouds.", "pred": "A white, metallic, reflective structure with angular edges is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum, suggesting a technical or industrial setting. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A white, metallic, reflective structure with angular edges is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum, suggesting a technical or industrial setting. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual elements: white, rectangular, metallic, reflective, and angular structures.\n2. Analyze the audio elements: continuous, low-frequency mechanical sound.\n3. Combine the visual and audio elements to form a cohesive description.\nThe visual elements consist of white, rectangular, metallic, reflective, and angular structures, while the audio element is a continuous, low-frequency mechanical sound.\nThe visual elements consist of white, rectangular, metallic, reflective, and angular structures, while the audio element is a continuous, low-frequency mechanical sound. These elements suggest a scene with technical equipment or machinery in operation, possibly indicating a server room or industrial setting. The combination of the visual and audio cues implies a controlled, functional environment where both visual and auditory stimuli are integral to the scene's atmosphere.\n\nA white, metallic, reflective structure with angular edges is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum, suggesting a technical or industrial setting. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 26.992, "generation_time_seconds": 25.524, "selection_time_seconds": 0.033, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0,