{"id": "38", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A horse-drawn carriage clip-clops through a lush green field with sheep grazing in the background and an engine idling nearby.", "pred": "The video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound. \\boxed{The video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound. \\boxed{The video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content: The video features a sequence of images depicting a green landscape with structures and pathways, including a bridge and a stone arch.\n2. Identify the audio content: The audio consists of a repetitive sound resembling a trotting horse.\n3. Combine the visual and audio elements: The video appears to be a series of still images of a green landscape that transitions to a close-up of the ground, while the audio suggests the presence of a horse trotting in the background.\nThe video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound.\nThe video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound. \\boxed{The video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound.}\n\nThe video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound. \\boxed{The video is a sequence of still images showing a green landscape with structures and pathways, transitioning to a close-up of the ground, while the audio features a repetitive trotting sound.}", "time_sec": 29.744, "generation_time_seconds": 28.1151, "selection_time_seconds": 0.171, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 2213, 25, 576, 2766, 4419, 264, 8500, 315, 5335, 59694, 264, 6176, 18414, 448, 14389, 323, 42914, 11, 2670, 264, 14164, 323, 264, 9798, 5325, 624, 17, 13, 64547, 279, 7699, 2213, 25, 576, 7699, 17167, 315, 264, 58077, 5112, 70607, 264, 56577, 1280, 15223, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 9124, 323, 7699, 5424, 25, 576, 2766, 7952, 311, 387, 264, 4013, 315, 2058, 5335, 315, 264, 6176, 18414, 429, 33592, 311, 264, 3265, 5239, 315, 279, 4910, 11, 1393, 279, 7699, 13230, 279, 9362, 315, 264, 15223, 56577, 1280, 304, 279, 4004, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.654, -0.0, -0.8587, -0.0006, -0.0087, -0.0459, -0.351, -0.4471, -0.1478, -0.2398, -4.0616, -0.0191, -3.1894, -0.0012, -1.1447, -2.5266, -0.4244, -2.0632, -2.1239, -0.0546, -7.0223, -1.7111, -0.6369, -0.0978, -4.5225, -0.1179, -2.5152, -0.194, -0.1998, -2.2647, -1.9947, -3.1769, -0.0, 0.0, -1.3217, -0.1218, -0.0552, -1.0142, 0.0, -0.2346, -0.1082, -0.9131, -0.0, -0.7075, -1.1752, -2.1238, -0.218, -0.1881, -1.7771, -0.0001, -0.0504, -0.4175, -0.0, 0.0, -0.3753, -0.0987, -0.941, -0.0, -0.0351, -0.2672, -0.0406, -0.0677, -0