{"id": "44", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man with no shirt on is laying in bed, with footsteps walking on a hard surface followed by a person snoring.", "pred": "A person in a workshop uses a power tool to work on a piece of wood, accompanied by continuous mechanical noise. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A person in a workshop uses a power tool to work on a piece of wood, accompanied by continuous mechanical noise. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the main audio event: The presence of a power tool or machine in operation, indicated by consistent mechanical noise.\n2. Analyze the visual elements: A person is seen holding a piece of wood, suggesting woodworking or carpentry activity.\n3. Combine audio and visual information: The person is likely using the power tool to cut or shape the wood.\n4. Consider the environment: The setting appears to be a workshop or similar space, as indicated by the machinery and the activity.\n5. Synthesize the details: The video shows a person in a workshop using a power tool to work on a piece of wood, with\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe visual shows a person in a workshop, holding a piece of wood and operating a power tool, while the audio features continuous mechanical noise, suggesting woodworking activity.\n\nA person in a workshop uses a power tool to work on a piece of wood, accompanied by continuous mechanical noise. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 25.385, "generation_time_seconds": 23.9121, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0986, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 9124, 5424, 25, 576, 2766, 4933, 264, 6319, 11, 99055, 6243, 448, 1257, 380, 7800, 20816, 323, 264, 24932, 39040, 624, 17, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 7699, 5424, 25, 44141, 315, 25868, 11, 4363, 75