{"id": "45", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows hard and the engine hums loud, a man drives a boat on a lake with a purple background.", "pred": "The video shows a purple background with wavy, white lines and shapes, while the audio contains a continuous, high-pitched, rhythmic machine or electronic sound. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video shows a purple background with wavy, white lines and shapes, while the audio contains a continuous, high-pitched, rhythmic machine or electronic sound. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content: The video shows a sequence of frames with a purple background and varying patterns of white, wavy lines and shapes.\n2. Analyze the audio content: There is a continuous, high-pitched, and rhythmic sound throughout the audio clip.\n3. Combine the analysis: The visual content presents abstract, animated patterns, while the audio features a consistent, high-pitched sound, possibly resembling a machine or electronic noise.\nThe visual sequence depicts a purple background with wavy, white lines and shapes, while the audio contains a continuous, high-pitched, rhythmic machine or electronic sound.\nThe visual sequence depicts a purple background with wavy, white lines and shapes, while the audio contains a continuous, high-pitched, rhythmic machine or electronic sound.\n\nThe video shows a purple background with wavy, white lines and shapes, while the audio contains a continuous, high-pitched, rhythmic machine or electronic sound. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 25.483, "generation_time_seconds": 24.0791, "selection_time_seconds": 0.081, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1