{"id": "49", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The whimpering of several small dogs can be heard as a group of puppies play together in the grass.", "pred": "A grid of diverse, textured tiles is shown while a dog whines and growls, creating a contrast between visual order and auditory distress. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A grid of diverse, textured tiles is shown while a dog whines and growls, creating a contrast between visual order and auditory distress. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual segment: A grid of variously colored, textured square tiles is displayed.\n2. Analyze the audio segment: A dog is whining and growling.\n3. Combine the analysis: The grid of tiles visually represents a diverse set of patterns, while the audio involves a dog expressing discomfort or distress.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nIntegrating these observations: The video juxtaposes a static, abstract pattern grid with the dynamic, emotional sounds of a distressed dog, creating a stark contrast between visual order and auditory unease.\n\nA grid of diverse, textured tiles is shown while a dog whines and growls, creating a contrast between visual order and auditory distress. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 25.458, "generation_time_seconds": 22.8818, "selection_time_seconds": 0.165, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151