{"id": "51", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man whistled as the small dogs on the bed looked into a mirror, followed by a yell as plastic rustled and clanked in the background.", "pred": "A grid of textured blocks in shades of brown and red is shown, with a cheerful whistle and a man saying \"Mama, what am I supposed to do?\" and \"Mama, come over here, baby.\" \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A grid of textured blocks in shades of brown and red is shown, with a cheerful whistle and a man saying \"Mama, what am I supposed to do?\" and \"Mama, come over here, baby.\" \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual elements: The video displays a grid of various textured blocks, resembling a crafting interface from a video game, predominantly in shades of brown and red.\n2. Analyze the audio: A cheerful, whistling tune plays in the background, followed by a male voice saying \"Mama, what am I supposed to do?\" and then \"Mama, come over here, baby.\"\n3. Combine visual and audio information: The combination of the game-like textures and the playful, possibly frustrated speech suggests a casual, lighthearted video game session.\nThe scene shows a grid of colorful textured blocks suggestive of a crafting interface, accompanied by a cheerful whistle and a playful, possibly frustrated dialogue from a man.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nA grid of textured blocks in shades of brown and red is shown, with a cheerful whistle and a man saying \"Mama, what am I supposed to do?\" and \"Mama, come over here, baby.\" \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 30.637, "generation_time_seconds": 28.8976, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0333, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 9124, 3565, 25, 362, 40230, 12681, 4573, 448, 264, 2518,