{"id": "61", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The revving idling engine hums as a crowd of people excitedly takes photos of a concept car on display at the auto show.", "pred": "The video displays a grid of various textures and materials in black, white, and shades of gray, while the audio captures the sound of an engine revving up, resulting in a mismatch between the visual and auditory modalities.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays a grid of various textures and materials in black, white, and shades of gray, while the audio captures the sound of an engine revving up, resulting in a mismatch between the visual and auditory modalities.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify visual details: The image consists of a grid of various textures, including patterns and materials, in black, white, and shades of gray.\n2. Identify audio details: The audio contains the sound of an engine revving up, possibly from a car or motorcycle.\n3. Combine sensory details: The visual texture grid does not match the audio of an engine, indicating a mismatch between the visual and audio modalities.\nThe final answer is:\nThe video shows a grid of various textures and materials in black, white, and shades of gray, while the audio features the sound of an engine revving up, creating a mismatch between the visual and auditory modalities.\nThe final answer is: The video displays a grid of various textures and materials in black, white, and shades of gray, while the audio captures the sound of an engine revving up, resulting in a mismatch between the visual and auditory modalities.\n\nThe video displays a grid of various textures and materials in black, white, and shades of gray, while the audio captures the sound of an engine revving up, resulting in a mismatch between the visual and auditory modalities.", "time_sec": 25.404, "generati