{"id": "62", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorcycle's engine chugged slowly before revving up, parked on the side of the street with a close-up view of its engine .", "pred": "The audio features a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visuals display a series of metallic, static images, creating a contrast between the mechanical sounds and the static visuals. \\boxed{Contrast between mechanical engine sounds and static metallic visuals.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The audio features a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visuals display a series of metallic, static images, creating a contrast between the mechanical sounds and the static visuals. \\boxed{Contrast between mechanical engine sounds and static metallic visuals.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content to identify textures and patterns, noting that the images are mostly metallic or textured surfaces.\n2. Observe the audio to identify the presence of a motorcycle engine starting and revving up.\n3. Combine the visual and audio descriptions, focusing on the contrast between the mechanical engine sounds and the static or textured visual backgrounds.\nThe visual content shows a series of static, textured images predominantly featuring metallic or industrial surfaces, while the audio captures the distinct sounds of a motorcycle engine starting and revving up, creating a stark contrast between the mechanical action and the still frames.\nThe audio features a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visuals display a series of metallic, static images, creating a contrast between the mechanical sounds and the static visuals. \\boxed{Contrast between mechanical engine sounds and static metallic visuals.}\n\nThe audio features a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visuals display a series of metallic, static images, creating a contrast between the mechanical sounds and the static visuals. \\boxed{Contrast between mechanical engine sounds and static metallic visuals.}", "time_sec": 24.215, "generation_time_seconds": 22.1861, "selection_time_seconds": 0.032, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 9124, 2213, 25, 362, 2504, 88, 11, 12955, 657, 2168, 448, 8115, 12624, 323, 7987, 624, 17, 13, 64547, 279, 7699, 2213, 25, 576, 5112, 315, 264, 34304, 4712, 877, 2718, 323, 1221, 5772, 4405, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 47969, 3565, 25, 576, 9124, 374, 264, 48204, 1506, 11, 7377, 13042, 1393, 279, 7699, 374, 264, 25489, 22148, 5112, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.263, -0.0, -0.8583, -0.088, -0.0437, -1.8872, -0.009, -0.6543, -7.4521, -0.5128, -0.0033, -0.2751, -0.0, -0.4104, -0.519, -5.5627, -0.8874, -0.246, -0.6796, -0.1276, -0.0, 0.0, -0.3981, -0.0, -0.0537, -0.0, 0.0, -0.5697, -0.0027, -0.0, -0.3612, -0.0225, -0.007, -0.5441, -0.0, -0.0725, -1.0595, -0.0512, 0.0, -1.3487, -0.0, 0.0, -0.1449, -0.0368, -0.6414, -0.082, -0.3096, -1.1267, -0.6185, -0.1655, -0.8842, -2.4315, 0.0, -0.1892, -1.227, -0.0605, -6.5312, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0298, -0.0436, -1.1575, -2.0544, -0.0057, -0.952, -0.0046, -33.9583, -17.0844, -15.9375, -15.4167, -4.5971], "cumulative_logprob": -130.6611, "norm_logp": -1.8147, "input_len": 1265, "output_tokens": 72}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 2213, 311, 10542, 29853, 323, 12624, 11, 26305, 429, 279, 5335, 525, 10008, 45158, 476, 73544, 26431, 624, 17, 13, 4657, 13267, 279, 7699, 311, 10542, 279, 9362, 315, 264, 34304, 4712, 5916, 323, 5772, 4405, 705, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 9124, 323, 7699, 27787, 11, 21080, 389, 279, 12872, 1948, 279, 22148, 4712, 10362, 323, 279, 1099, 476, 73544, 9124, 35476, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.4067, -0.0, -0.6288, -0.00