{"id": "75", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene ambiance of a bathroom, water softly flows as a man speaks amidst the presence of a shower head, a toothbrush, an umbrella on a tripod, and a person holding a plunger.", "pred": "The video displays abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black, overlaid with the continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black, overlaid with the continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content: The video shows a sequence of abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black shades, with no clear subjects or objects.\n2. Examine the audio content: There is a continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone.\n3. Combine the analysis: The visuals do not depict the source of the alarm sound, which is the water running.\n4. Formulate a concise, dense description: The video consists of abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black, accompanied by a continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone.\nThe video displays abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black, overlaid with the continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone.\nThe audio is a continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone, while the visuals show abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black.\n\nThe video displays abstract, pixelated patterns in brown, gray, and black, overlaid with the continuous sound of water running and a loud, repetitive alarm tone. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 31.613, "generation_time_seconds": 29.7784, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1122, "record_process": true, "stage