{"id": "78", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The high frequency humming followed by a smack woke up the person sleeping on the bed with a blanket and pillow and drone making sound.", "pred": "A sequence of abstract patterns and colors transitions to a patterned surface with a blue line, accompanied by the sound of a door opening and closing. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A sequence of abstract patterns and colors transitions to a patterned surface with a blue line, accompanied by the sound of a door opening and closing. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual parts of the video independently, focusing on the sequence of patterns and colors.\n2. Identify any transitions or changes in the visual scenes, noting the colors and shapes.\n3. Review the audio events for any distinctive sounds or effects, such as a door opening or closing.\n4. Combine the visual and auditory elements to describe the overall scene in the most concise and accurate manner possible.\nThe visual scenes show a sequence of abstract patterns and colors, including black lines and shapes on a white background, and a transition to a patterned surface with a blue line. The audio includes the sound of a door opening and closing.\nThe visual scenes show a sequence of abstract patterns and colors, including black lines and shapes on a white background, and a transition to a patterned surface with a blue line. The audio includes the sound of a door opening and closing.\n\nA sequence of abstract patterns and colors transitions to a patterned surface with a blue line, accompanied by the sound of a door opening and closing. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 25.413, "generation_time_seconds": 22.5263, "selection_time_seconds": 0.204, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_id