{"id": "81", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rattling accompanies a man riding a motorcycle on a trail through a wooded area.", "pred": "A motorcyclist navigates a forest trail, wearing protective gear, while the audio includes the sound of a motorcycle engine and a man speaking. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A motorcyclist navigates a forest trail, wearing protective gear, while the audio includes the sound of a motorcycle engine and a man speaking. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual elements present in the video.\n2. Describe the visual elements in detail, focusing on specific nouns and adjectives.\n3. Identify any audio elements present in the video.\n4. Describe the audio elements in detail, focusing on specific nouns and adjectives.\n5. Combine the visual and audio descriptions into a single sentence, ensuring both are included and no assumptions are made.\nThe visual elements show a cluttered, chaotic scene with various objects like a green plant, a white vase, and a blue and white patterned surface, all set against a blurry, abstract background. The audio features a man speaking, followed by a soft, muffled voice, then a sound effect resembling a splatter or liquid.\nThe visual elements depict a disorganized space with objects such as a green plant, a white vase, and a blue and white patterned surface amidst a blurry abstract backdrop, while the audio includes a man speaking, a soft muffled voice, and a splatter-like sound.\n\nA motorcyclist navigates a forest trail, wearing protective gear, while the audio includes the sound of a motorcycle engine and a man speaking. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 25.341, "generation_time_seconds": 23.8087, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0295, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout