{"id": "104", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A birds chirping sound the wire fence at various animals, accompanied by the soothing sounds .", "pred": "The video depicts a serene digital representation of a natural outdoor environment with pixelated textures of grass and foliage, accompanied by the sounds of birds chirping. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video depicts a serene digital representation of a natural outdoor environment with pixelated textures of grass and foliage, accompanied by the sounds of birds chirping. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content: The video displays a grid of pixelated textures resembling grass and foliage.\n2. Identify the audio: Birds are chirping, creating a serene outdoor ambiance.\n3. Cross-reference the visual and audio: The visual textures correspond to the natural setting suggested by the bird sounds.\n4. Synthesize the information: The video appears to depict a digital representation of a natural environment, likely a video game or digital art piece.\nThe video showcases a grid of pixelated textures mimicking grass and foliage, accompanied by the sounds of birds chirping, suggesting a digital recreation of a natural outdoor setting.\nThe visual and audio elements together depict a serene digital representation of a natural outdoor environment, likely a digital art piece or video game with pixelated textures and bird sounds. The grid of textures includes various shades of green for grass and foliage, and the audio captures the chirping of birds, enhancing the natural ambiance. The visual and audio elements are consistent with a peaceful digital recreation of a natural setting, possibly designed to evoke a sense of calm and connection with nature through digital means.\n\nThe video depicts a serene digital representation of a natural outdoor environment with pixelated textures of grass and foliage, accompanied by the sounds of birds chirping. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 26.91, "generation_time_seconds": 25.431, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0303, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 9124, 14087, 34783, 264, 5827, 315, 40230, 29853, 11, 30606, 315, 5257, 16359, 11, 25284, 11, 323, 9798, 10010, 11, 1393, 279, 7699, 4419, 264, 883, 12094, 304, 264, 3347, 11, 41523, 398, 7743, 448, 9956, 323, 11958, 10362, 304, 279, 4004, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -2.683, -3.5054, -3.4892, -4.1576, -0.1298, -0.8167, -0.0057, -2.0127, -0.3293, -0.2706, -6.6932, -0.0012, -0.1427, -0.5266, -1.0608, -0.1818, -0.0, -0.0301, -0.079, -0.054, -0.1877, -0.5303, -0.0362, -0.0024, -0.454, -0.2017, -1.431, -0.0667, -0.1732, -0.0754, -1.3202, -0.0329, -1.1384, -0.0, -0.4288, -1.4362, -3.1256, -0.1884, -0.0509, -0.0064, -0.0252, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0236, -0.0056, -34.1667, -12.649, -9.7566, -10.4321, -6.8885, -9.6363, -11.2934, -12.0945, -12.0922, -10.0996, -9.2139, -9.6521, -9.4723, -8.9777, -7.9221, -8.3359, -9.1689, -8.9614, -11.6677, -12.7091, -12.7087, -12.5002, -10.0003, -8.751, -7.2975, -7.0986, -7.3061, -7.3143, -6.2817, -6.1, -4.3389, -3.7631, -3.9907, -4.3809, -5.3818, -6.0972, -5.6578, -5.1586, -4.5636, -4.9075, -5.2193, -4.3863, -4.5036, -6.0677, -6.6668, -6.4871, -5.605], "cumulative_logprob": -434.8345, "norm_logp": -4.6756, "input_len": 1265, "output_tokens": 93}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 2213, 25, 576, 2766, 18689, 2