{"id": "108", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows, a young man wearing glasses and a black jacket with a hood walks in the park, whistling a tune.", "pred": "A person wearing a black coat with a fur-lined hood is outdoors in a park, whistling a tune. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A person wearing a black coat with a fur-lined hood is outdoors in a park, whistling a tune. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual elements: The video consists of various textures and patterns, including black and white stripes, abstract shapes, and a mix of colors that appear to be in motion.\n2. Identify the audio elements: The audio includes a consistent, musical whistling sound that persists throughout the clip.\n3. Combine the observations: The visual content is abstract and dynamic, while the audio is a continuous, melodic whistle.\n\\boxed{Abstract, dynamic visuals featuring black and white stripes and abstract shapes, accompanied by a continuous, melodic whistle.}\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nA person wearing a black coat with a fur-lined hood is outdoors in a park, whistling a tune. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 45.686, "generation_time_seconds": 44.3412, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0367, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 5424, 315, 279, 1156, 2766, 4034, 11, 21080, 389, 279, 29853, 323, 12624, 3042, 624, 17, 13, 64547, 279, 9362, 315, 264, 1697, 304, 279, 9124, 5424, 11, 26305, 279, 17438, 323, 47278, 624, 18, 13, 32149, 311, 279, 7699, 5424, 315, 279, 1156, 2766, 4034, 11, 21080, 389, 279, 4494, 315, 10362, 323, 862, 11639, 624, 19, 13, 64547, 279, 3151, 10362, 315, 420, 380, 2718, 323, 3738, 23314, 11, 26305, 862, 18405, 323, 16230, 624, 20, 13, 11261, 72623, 279, 9124, 323