{"id": "121", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption captures the essence of a lively event with music, male speech, and distant sizzling, featuring a collage of pictures of men wearing hats and sunglasses, celebrating in a crowd.", "pred": "A pixelated crafting interface grid is shown with a gravelly Southern voice introducing himself as Big Kenny, accompanied by a slow, dark instrumental track. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A pixelated crafting interface grid is shown with a gravelly Southern voice introducing himself as Big Kenny, accompanied by a slow, dark instrumental track. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the visual content: The video shows a grid of various textures, resembling a crafting or inventory interface from a video game, with a dark background and colorful, pixelated items.\n2. Recognize the audio content: The audio features a male voice speaking in a deep, gravelly tone, with a musical track playing in the background.\n3. Analyze the speech: The speech is in English, with the speaker saying, \"hey this is Big Kenny sound assistant.\" The voice has a distinct Southern accent.\n4. Note the background music: The music is instrumental, with no clear lyrics, and has a slow,\ndark, atmospheric quality, possibly electronic or ambient in genre.\nThe video displays a grid of pixelated textures resembling a crafting interface, accompanied by a gravelly-voiced Southern speaker introducing himself as Big Kenny, with a slow, dark instrumental track playing in the background.\n\nA pixelated crafting interface grid is shown with a gravelly Southern voice introducing himself as Big Kenny, accompanied by a slow, dark instrumental track. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 24.608, "generation_time_seconds": 22.8549, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0275, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"st