{"id": "132", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a woman speaks affectionately, a pig oinks  on the bed.", "pred": "The video shows a collage of fragmented, distorted squares in brown and black, resembling a glitched image, while audio reveals a concerned voice asking, \"what are you doing under there?\" \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video shows a collage of fragmented, distorted squares in brown and black, resembling a glitched image, while audio reveals a concerned voice asking, \"what are you doing under there?\" \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual content: The video displays a collage of fragmented, distorted squares with varying shades of brown and black, resembling a glitched or corrupted image.\n2. Analyze the audio content: The audio features a person speaking in a concerned tone, saying \"what are you doing under there.\"\n3. Combine the analyses: The visual content appears to be abstract or corrupted, while the audio provides a specific, clear context of someone asking about an action being performed underneath something.\nThe video shows a collage of fragmented, distorted squares in brown and black, resembling a glitched image, while audio reveals a concerned voice asking, \"what are you doing under there?\"\nThe video exhibits a chaotic, fragmented collage of brown and black squares, suggesting digital corruption, while the audio conveys a person's worried query about an activity beneath something.\n\nThe video shows a collage of fragmented, distorted squares in brown and black, resembling a glitched image, while audio reveals a concerned voice asking, \"what are you doing under there?\" \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 23.918, "generation_time_seconds": 22.327, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0298, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam"