{"id": "140", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene setting of nature, a man speaks amidst the chirping of birds and the squeaking of a frog, as a green frog and a snake coexist in the dirt with rocks and plants nearby.", "pred": "\\boxed{Abstract geometric patterns in various colors with angry Chinese speech.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Abstract geometric patterns in various colors with angry Chinese speech.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual elements: The frame shows a collection of abstract, geometric patterns with various textures and colors, primarily in shades of gray, black, green, and blue, arranged in a grid-like structure.\n2. Analyze the audio elements: The audio features a voice speaking in Chinese, using a tone that conveys a sense of anger or frustration.\n3. Combine the sensory details: The visual and audio elements are presented independently without any direct contradiction or overlap in content.\n4. Ensure no assumptions: The visual patterns are described as abstract and geometric, without inferring any specific objects or scenes.\n5. Ensure mod\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe frame contains a grid of abstract, geometric patterns in various colors, while the audio features an angry voice speaking in Chinese.\n\n\\boxed{Abstract geometric patterns in various colors with angry Chinese speech.}", "time_sec": 29.185, "generation_time_seconds": 27.7915, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0358, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 2213, 25, 576, 2766, 4933, 264, 4013, 315, 8115, 11, 12955, 657, 12624, 304, 3691, 11, 4158, 11, 323, 36099, 315, 6176, 624, 17, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 7699, 2213, 25, 362, 8593, 7743, 374, 12094, 304, 264, 2477, 15598, 4128, 11, 11689, 484