{"id": "161", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  woman stood in front of the black and white mural, surrounded by paintings of skulls, skeletons, and a fox, as they heard the sound of spraying and hissing with light vibrations..", "pred": "\\boxed{Abstract, pixelated visuals with continuous high-pitched buzzing sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Abstract, pixelated visuals with continuous high-pitched buzzing sound.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. The video shows a series of abstract, pixelated squares and rectangles in various colors and patterns.\n2. There is a continuous, high-pitched, electronic buzzing sound throughout the video.\n3. The visual content does not depict any identifiable objects or scenes, only abstract shapes and colors.\n4. The audio does not contain any spoken words or human voices.\nThe reason for the next logical step is to confirm the detailed sensory input as described, ensuring no contradictions or assumptions are made between the visual and auditory elements.\nThe next logical reasoning step is to verify the consistency of the visual and auditory descriptions, ensuring that the abstract shapes and colors do not contradict the continuous high-pitched buzzing sound, and vice versa. This ensures that the sensory details are accurately and independently analyzed without introducing assumptions or contradictions.\n\n\\boxed{Abstract, pixelated visuals with continuous high-pitched buzzing sound.}", "time_sec": 24.458, "generation_time_seconds": 22.9225, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0304, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645,