{"id": "163", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a man in a cap looks at the camera and makes a funny face and  speaking ,whistling sound.", "pred": "A man speaks while chaotic whistling sounds are heard in the background. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A man speaks while chaotic whistling sounds are heard in the background. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps are:\n1. Identify the visual content: A blurry, moving scene with indistinct shapes and colors.\n2. Analyze the audio: A man speaking followed by a series of whistling sounds.\n3. Combine visual and audio information: A man is speaking in a chaotic, possibly stressful situation, indicated by the whistling and speech.\n4. Ensure modality independence and avoid assumptions: Focus on the actual sounds and visuals without inferring additional details.\n5. Compress and format the description into a concise, factual sentence.\nThe video depicts a man speaking amidst a chaotic environment with intermittent whistling, indicating stress or urgency.\n\nA man speaks while chaotic whistling sounds are heard in the background. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 24.587, "generation_time_seconds": 23.317, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0265, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 2213, 25, 576, 2766, 4933, 264, 4013, 315, 8115, 11, 72400, 11, 323, 86095, 5335, 448, 5257, 7987, 323, 20816, 11, 6825, 264, 827, 14881, 287, 2456, 624, 17, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 7699, 2213, 25, 2619, 374, 264, 883, 12094, 304, 264, 19300, 16232, 11, 8110, 553, 264, 10968, 11, 17361, 11, 1550, 2268, 92403, 5112, 2456, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 9124, 323, 7699, 5424, 25, 576, 9124, 2213, 374, 8115, 323, 51987, 11, 1393, 279, 7699, 38919, 264, 10968, 11, 16500, 23