{"id": "173", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cordless drill with a battery in it is being used to work on something, creating vibrations and humming as it starts and stops several times.", "pred": "A grid of abstract shapes in blue, black, orange, and gray is shown while a steady, rhythmic drilling sound is heard. \\boxed{}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A grid of abstract shapes in blue, black, orange, and gray is shown while a steady, rhythmic drilling sound is heard. \\boxed{}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify visual elements: A grid of abstract shapes and patterns in shades of blue, black, and orange.\n2. Analyze audio: A consistent, rhythmic drilling sound.\n3. Combine observations: The visual grid is static, while the audio is a continuous drilling noise, both independent of each other.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n1. Identify visual elements: Multiple abstract shapes and patterns in a grid, featuring blue, black, orange, and gray tones.\n2. Analyze audio: A persistent, rhythmic drilling sound.\n3. Combine observations: The visual grid remains unchanged, and the audio consists of a continuous, steady drilling noise.\n\nA grid of abstract shapes in blue, black, orange, and gray is shown while a steady, rhythmic drilling sound is heard. \\boxed{}", "time_sec": 26.131, "generation_time_seconds": 23.878, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1899, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 9124, 5424, 25, 362, 5827, 315, 5257, 13055, 29853, 11, 15503, 304, 18575, 11, 6303, 11, 323, 3691, 624, 17, 13, 64547, 279, 7699, 5424, 25, 362, 30546, 476, 2355, 5392, 10350, 304, 279, 4004, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 9124, 323, 7699, 5424, 25, 576, 2766, 4933, 264, 3265, 5239, 315, 13055, 29853, 1393, 264, 30546, 374, 6617, 304, 279, 4