{"id": "212", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "The video starts with a black screen displaying white text in Greek, transitions to a dark blue background with white text, features visual effects like sparkles and glowing lines, and ends with a man speaking in a foreign language with sound effects of a horse neighing and a door slamming, accompanied by a whooshing noise and an explosion.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video starts with a black screen displaying white text in Greek, transitions to a dark blue background with white text, features visual effects like sparkles and glowing lines, and ends with a man speaking in a foreign language with sound effects of a horse neighing and a door slamming, accompanied by a whooshing noise and an explosion.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Analyze the visual elements of the video frames.\n2. Identify the presence of a black screen with white text in Greek.\n3. Note the transition to a dark blue background with white text.\n4. Observe visual effects and animations, including sparkles and glowing lines.\n5. Capture the sound of a whooshing noise followed by an explosion.\n6. Document the transition to a scene with a man speaking in a foreign language, possibly Russian, with accompanying sound effects of a horse neighing and a door slamming.\n7. Combine all sensory details into a concise, factual description without assumptions or smoothing out contradictions.\nThe audio features a whooshing noise followed by an explosion, while the video transitions from a black screen with white text to a dark blue background with white text, followed by visual effects and animations, and finally to a scene with a man speaking in a foreign language with sound effects of a horse neighing and a door slamming.\nThe final answer is: \\boxed{The video begins with black screens displaying white text in Greek, transitions to a dark blue background with white text, and features visual effects like sparkles and glowing lines, followed by a man speaking in a foreign language with sound effects of a horse neighing and a door slamming, accompanied by a whooshing noise and an explosion.}\n\nThe video starts with a black screen displaying white text in Greek, transitions to a dark blue background with white text, features visual effects like sparkles and glowing lines, and ends with a man speaking in a foreign language with sound effects of a horse neighing and a door slamming, accompanied by a whooshing noise and an explosion.", "time_sec": 31.442, "generation_time_seconds": 29.3111, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1328, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 9124, 5424, 315, 279, 2766, 14087, 624, 17, 13, 64547, 279, 9362, 315, 264, 3691, 4171, 448, 4158, 1467, 304, 17860, 624, 18, 13, 7036, 279, 9142, 311, 264, 6319, 6303, 4004, 448, 4158, 1467, 624, 19, 13, 4657, 13267, 9124, 6239, 323, 26053, 11, 2670, 15186, 642, 323, 48492, 5128, 624, 20, 13, 39885, 279, 5112, 315, 264, 879, 9267, 287, 11980, 8110, 553, 458, 24199, 624, 21, 13, 11789, 279, 9142, 311, 264, 6109, 448, 264, 883, 12094, 304, 264, 7214, 4128, 11, 10767, 8522, 11, 448, 23534, 5112, 6239, 315, 264, 15223, 96166, 287, 323, 264, 6006, 91860, 624, 22, 13, 46812, 678, 47969, 3565, 1119, 264, 63594, 11, 59901, 4008, 2041, 31846, 476, 61961, 700, 80423, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.1977, -0.0, -0.9923, -0.0006, -0.0014, -0.0605, -0.687, -3.4665, -0.0028, -0.1817, -1.3359, -0.8913, -0.0045, 0.0, -0.0978, -0.2324, -1.4307, -0.0009, -1.0525, -1.6049, -0.8169, -0.0254, -0.8635, -0.0989, -1.813, -1.9738, -0.6146, -0